        'To record quickly, tap \xabAdd\xbb in the bottom menu; with \xab\u2630\xbb and \xabEdit Home\xbb you can remove, add or move the dashboard cards and widgets.',
      'ChatGPT / Claude': 'ChatGPT / Claude',
